Z||000000||Adrift||07-02-2001||10:13 PM||||A few people complained about my asking too many "simple" questions - so here's my question for you all - why don't we have a Fiero FAQ for this board? This would have saved me a few days of asking questions, and will help the same questions being repeated over and over again. If we have one already, then why isn't it publicized more. If we don't, I just volunteered to begin compiling it.||||reg||5
Z||000001||Black88GT||07-02-2001||10:16 PM||||I was going to make one a while back, collected about 10 or 12 questions but no one ever gave me any more, didn't seem to be much interest at the time.  <P>Maybe Cliff could help us out, add it to the table of links.  We could add to it regularly.  I am sure MM, batboy (where ya been?), and theogre could contribute a lot since they have been here for a long time.  Also other members too.  ||||reg||14
Z||000002||Adrift||07-02-2001||10:30 PM||||I was thinking something along the lines of splitting up the faq into questions about each part - For example:<P>Engine:<BR>What's the best way to get more torque out of a 4cyl?<P>Suspension:<BR>How do I limit my cars body roll?<P>Brakes:<BR>What's the safest way to upgrade my breaks?<P>Interior:<BR>How can I change the color of my gauges?<P>Sound System:<BR>How can I insulate my car against outside noise better?<P>Etc, etc, etc...||||reg||1
Z||000003||Hartz||07-02-2001||10:59 PM||||My guess is that we couldn't get three people to agree to a common answer to a question without a flame war breaking out.  It's starting to get bad around here.   <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/forum/frown.gif"><P>Hartz<BR>'84 SC 5.7L V8<BR>'85 SE 3.1L V6 Turbo||||reg||9
Z||000004||Monkeyman||07-03-2001||05:49 AM||||I'm not sure it would work simply because there are so many frequently asked questions.  You'd still have to do a search to find the right topic.  Most FAQ pages are for things that only have 10 or 12 questions (re: Archies engine swaps or most kit cars).<P>------------------<BR>'Consciousness:  That annoying time between naps.'<P>MM||||reg||1
Z||000005||DRH||07-03-2001||09:35 AM||||Actually <B>Ogre's Cave</B> (small link at the top and bottom of every page) covers a lot. I think theogre said he would add other stuff if people sent it to him. Maybe it should be marked more prominently as a "FAQ" for new members that have no idea who theogre is. BTW Cliff, the link takes you to a "this page has been moved page" first...<p>[This message has been edited by DRH (edited 07-03-2001).]||||reg||1
Z||000006||Cliff Pennock||07-03-2001||01:33 PM||||I'm all for a FAQ. And I think Ogre is the  most qualified person to be in charge of this. Tell me what you need to get this FAQ thing going (like webspace or something).||||reg||1
